BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DEEP CANVASSING CONVERSATIONS | June 26\, 27\, 28 in Fresno!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T150000
UID:2b3757a700fd649167e6e800fb50b385@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20CD22_20260301173410747656.png
DESCRIPTION:**It's time to talk to voters in CD22!** Let's build the grass
 roots power Democrats need to win in 2026 and to defend democracy long ter
 m. Join us in going door-to-door talking to voters. We'll employ **deep ca
 nvassing techniques** such as active listening to open our 2026 voter conv
 ersations and learn which issues are important to them. **$100 stipend** a
  day available to offset the cost of gas and lodging. - Friday\, June 26 |
  9:30 am to 6:00 pm - Saturday\, June 27 | 9:30 am to 6:00 pm - Sunday
LOCATION:Volunteer travel to Fresno!\, San Jose\, CA\, 95123
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/920437/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
