BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seed the Vote Info Session: Get Involved in 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260622T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260622T130000
UID:03fdd0865fe34c011494364a01e568dd@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20header%20-%202026%20resistance%20elections%20%2812
 00%20x%20630%20px%29_20260302184625582000.png
DESCRIPTION:In 2026\, we have to fight like none of us have ever fought be
 fore. Seed the Vote has two big goals for 2026: 1) Elect progressive candi
 dates in the spring/summer primaries 2) Win the House in the November midt
 erm elections\, *AND* work to win a Senate majority Seed the Vote is conne
 cting volunteers to key races in multiple states. Right now\, we're recrui
 ting volunteers to join us in June & July in Bakersfield\, CA\, and Michig
 an to doorknock for exciting progressives in the primaries. Join an info 
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/seedthevote/event/914225/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
