BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MoveOn Primary Election Phone Banks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260622T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260622T170000
UID:bd5c59facfcbd79e099e75613f44965b@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/General%20Phonebank%20-%20Support_20260611143053487693.png
DESCRIPTION:Join MoveOn members from across the country calling local vote
 rs in support of MoveOn's endorsed primary candidates! On Monday\, June 22
  we'll make calls in support of Brad Lander\, endorsed by Mayor Mamdani an
 d Bernie Sanders for New York's 10th Congressional District. No experience
  is necessary—a complete training will be provided at the top of the cal
 l. We look forward to seeing you there!
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/moveon/event/796084/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
